服。王怒，將以翟伐鄭。富辰諫曰：「凡我周之東徙，晉、鄭焉依。子穨之亂，又鄭之由定，今以小怨棄之！」王不聽。十五年，王降翟師以伐鄭。王德翟人，將以其女為后。富辰諫曰：「平、桓、莊、惠皆受鄭勞，王棄親親翟，不可從。」王不聽。十六年，王絀翟后，翟人來誅，殺譚伯。富辰曰：「吾數諫不從。如是不出，王以我為懟乎？」乃以其屬死之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"游孫","kind":"person","person_id":"658_fyo_lfi","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"伯服","kind":"person","person_id":"fiw_di7_wro","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"鄭文公","kind":"person","person_id":"jdp_e3u_rug","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yr6_rws_tx8","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"厲公","kind":"person","person_id":"3f0_m1h_7ah","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"gt1_z7d_s3u","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"伯服","kind":"person","person_id":"fiw_di7_wro","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"富辰","kind":"person","person_id":"4y3_xk6_8vs","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"子穨","kind":"person","person_id":"gdy_039_7n5","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"其女","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"富辰","kind":"person","person_id":"4y3_xk6_8vs","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0132","start":132,"end":139,"surface":"平、桓、莊、惠","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-00